# Exception: the analysis design docs under output/analysis/ are authored
# reasoning/methodology (which empirical choice was made and why, bugs
# found and fixed), not regenerable pipeline output like the rest of
# output/ - checked in for the same reason ground_truth/ is, below. The
# CSVs alongside them (chord_sequences.csv, note_similarity_matrix.csv,
# etc.) stay ignored - regenerable via `make build-chord-sequences` /
# `make run-note-alignment` / etc. from the committed scripts. Git can't
# re-include a file whose parent directory is itself ignored, so /output/
# is excluded one level down (/output/*), not as a whole directory, to
# leave room for these nested re-includes.
/output/*
!/output/analysis/
/output/analysis/*
!/output/analysis/*.md
ground_truth_anchor/*/*.wav
ground_truth_anchor/*/*.mid
